tions is a missing prerequisite, not a mechanism refutation. Do not tune d or kappa after this outcome without a new prospective plan.'),dict(parent_ref='g2-r0013-inclusive_factorized',intervention='2x2 factorial: (diversity_joint - exposure_joint) - (diversity_factorized - exposure_factorized), calculated from validation macro AUC.',control='diversity_factorized versus exposure_factorized removes only the covariance contribution; raw fractions, centered projected-mean products, covariance computation and active projection capacity stay matched. Existing g2-r0013-inclusive_joint/factorized anchor the original contrast.',held_fixed=fixed,remaining_confounds=confounds+['AUC differences are an operational performance interaction, not an additive decomposition of loss or a causal biological/statistical mechanism.'],decision_if_supported='If diversity helps both moment modes, describe a general reliability representation effect; if only joint improves and the interaction repeats, provisionally attribute dependence on joint moments. Report each main effect and the difference in differences with paired uncertainty when authorized.',decision_if_not_supported='Do not attribute diversity utility specifically to joint coupling. Preserve all four outcomes including reversals; keep stronger validated source/incumbent.'),dict(parent_ref='g0-r0003-relation_content_counts',intervention='Compare the frozen suite winner to imported relation-content and count-shrink source bests and DIN, under the common full-data protocol.',control='g0-r0003-relation_content_counts macro AUC0.8275704845768582; g2-r0004-count_shrink0.8272805336635536; baseline-din0.8099233880793816; incumbent0.8280959704981011.',held_fixed=fixed[:5],remaining_confounds=['Sources differ in total capacity and actual cost; source improvements alone do not isolate this reliability mechanism.','The count-shrink source has fewer parameters and lower measured wall cost; full quality-cost claims must include it.']+confounds[3