ion of those external methods.',transformed_mechanism='No component adopted from this card. New support statistic is motivated by the local count-only gate and explicit synthetic reliability contrast.',variant_names=[],nearest_work_difference='Keep all current unified interaction and feedback modules; modify only exposure-versus-identity-concentration reliability within existing feedback slots. No original-method equivalence or global novelty claimed.',falsifier='If duplicate-sensitive support fails against matched exposure controls, this local hypothesis is unsupported; this does not test the entire external method.'))\nproposal=dict(study=study,parent_trial='g2-r0011-center_count',variants=variants,knowledge_assessments=assess)\n(w/'proposal.json').write_text(json.dumps(proposal,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Wrote proposal.json with',len(variants),'standalone variants; prospective checks pending.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
